   475                              <1> printDecimalValLB:
   476                              <1> ;Takes a value in rax and prints it's decimal representation with leading
   477                              <1> ; blanks and inserts commas where appropriate.
   478                              <1> ;Input: rax = Value to print
   479                              <1> ;       rcx = Buffer size to handle (usual values: 17 for max, 13 for dword)
